    <!-- Launcher screen -->
    <string name="main_tagline">A video player for Stremio that keeps playing in a floating picture-in-picture window, like Netflix and YouTube.</string>
    <string name="main_setup_title">Use it with Stremio</string>
    <string name="main_setup_steps">1. In Stremio, open Settings → Player and choose S Player as the external player. If Stremio asks which app to open a stream with, pick S Player.\n2. Start any movie or episode. It opens full screen in S Player.\n3. Swipe or press Home (or tap the picture-in-picture button) and the video keeps playing in a floating window. Drag it anywhere, tap it for controls, or drag it to the bottom of the screen to close it.</string>
